  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Teater S O Asien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Theatre S E Asia - Children&#xB4;s Voice 2006-09</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the overall management of Swedish ITI, 10 theatre organisations in China, Laos and Vietnam will develop capacity in children&apos;s theatre and build examples with opportunity for replication. The project intends to address poverty and inequality by giving voice to children, with special emphasis on underprivileged girls and boys.</narrative>
  </description>
